              - ::
                type: "markdown-text"
                mode: "markdown"
                content: "- 🎮 **Retro Game in JS** - Snake, but with better graphics\n- 📊 **Data Viz Library** - Because D3 is overkill for pie charts\n- 🤖 **Slack Bot** - Tells terrible jokes on demand\n- 🎵 **Music Player** - Winamp nostalgia, browser edition\n- 📝 **Markdown Editor** - Distraction-free writing tool"
                css: "color: #34495e; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; margin: 0;"

  # Writing Page
